arch on dietary fish consumption and health risks."}{"title": "DONG J:Dong J is a researcher who contributed to studies on fish consumption and cancer risk."}{"title": "CAMPBELL F:Campbell F is an author who conducted a systematic review of fish(\"entity\""}{"title": "J NUTR:The Journal of Nutrition (J Nutr) publishes research on the role of nutrition in health and disease."}{"title": "J AM BOARD FAM MED:The Journal of the American Board of Family Medicine (J Am Board Fam Med) publishes research relevant to family medicine, including dietary studies."}{"title": "ADV NUTR:Advances in Nutrition (Adv Nutr) is a journal that publishes research on nutrition and its impact on health."}{"title": "WORLDVIEWS EVID BASED NURS:Worldviews on Evidence-Based Nursing publishes research on evidence-based practices in nursing, including dietary interventions."}{"title": "WORLD J GASTROENTEROL:The World Journal of Gastroenterology is a prominent medical journal dedicated to publishing research related to gastroenterology and digestive diseases. It focuses on various aspects of gastrointestinal health, including the impacts of diet and the role of artificial nutrition, particularly in cancer patients. The journal serves as a platform for disseminating significant findings and advancements in the field, contributing to the understanding and treatment of digestive health issues."}{"title": "EUR J PREV CARDIOL:The European Journal of Preventive Cardiology publishes research on cardiovascular health, including dietary studies."}{"title": "BMC CARDIOVASC DISORD:BMC Cardiovascular Disorders is a peer-reviewed journal dedicated to the research and treatment of cardiovascular diseases. It publishes a wide range of studies related to cardiovascular disorders, including investigations into the role of diet in both the prevention and treatment of these conditions."}{"title": "INT J CARDIOL:The International Journal of Cardiology is a peer-reviewed journal that publishes articles on cardiovascular medicine."}{"title": "CAN J CARDIOL:The Canadian Journal of Cardiology, abbreviated as CAN J CARDIOL, is a peer-reviewed publication dedicated to cardiovascular health and research. It focuses on disseminating research findings related to cardiovascular health specifically within Canada, contributing to the advancement of knowledge and practices in the field."}{"title": "AM J HYPERTENS:The American Journal of Hypertension is a peer-reviewed journal that focuses on hypertension research and treatment."}{"title": "HEART:Heart is a peer-reviewed journal that publishes research on cardiovascular medicine and related fields."}{"title": "EL KHOURY F:El Khoury F is a researcher who has contributed to meta-analyses on omega-3 fatty acids in cardiovascular patients."}{"title": "BIELINSKI M:Bielinski M is a researcher who has co-authored studies on omega-3 fatty acids and cardiovascular events."}{"title": "SCHILLER I:Schiller I is a researcher involved in cardiovascular studies focusing on omega-3 fatty acids."}{"title": "DENDUKURI N:Dendukuri N is a researcher who has contributed to meta-analyses on omega-3 fatty acids and cardiovascular health."}{"title": "BROPHY JM:Brophy JM is a researcher who has worked on studies related to omega-3 fatty acids and cardiovascular outcomes."}{"title": "WEN YT:Wen YT is a researcher who has conducted studies on omega-3 fatty acids and their effects on cardiovascular events."}{"title": "DAI JH:Dai JH is a researcher involved in meta-analyses regarding omega-3 fatty acids and coronary heart disease."}{"title": "GAO Q:Gao Q is a researcher who has contributed to studies on omega-3 fatty acids and cardiovascular mortality."}{"title": "YANG B:Yang B is a researcher who has published studies on the relationship between fish intake and cardiovascular health."}{"title": "SHI MQ:Shi MQ is a researcher involved in studies on long-chain n-3 PUFA and blood pressure."}{"title": "LI ZH:Li ZH is a researcher who has contributed to studies on omega-3 fatty acids and cardiovascular health."}{"title": "LI D:Li D is a multifaceted researcher who has made significant contributions to various fields of study. They are notably involved in research on glutamine supplementation in hematopoietic stem cell transplantation, exploring its potential benefits and applications. Additionally, Li D has conducted studies examining dietary factors that influence cardiovascular health, highlighting the importance of nutrition in maintaining heart health. Furthermore, Li D has investigated the ratio of n, although the specific context of this research is not detailed in the provided descriptions. Overall, Li D's work spans critical areas of health and nutrition, reflecting a commitment to advancing knowledge in these important domains."}{"title": "MILLER PE:Miller PE is a researcher who has published studies on long-chain omega-3 fatty acids and blood pressure."}{"title": "VAN ELSWYK M:Van Elswyk M is a researcher who has contributed to studies on omega-3 fatty acids and cardiovascular health."}{"title": "ALEXANDER DD:Alexander DD is a researcher involved in meta-analyses regarding omega-3 fatty acids and cardiovascular outcomes."}{"title": "KHOUEIRY G:Khoueiry G is a researcher who has studied the effects of omega-3 fatty acids on cardiac events."}{"title": "ABI RAFEH N:Abi Rafeh N is a researcher involved in studies on omega-3 fatty acids and sudden cardiac death."}{"title": "SULLIVAN E:Sullivan E is a researcher who has contributed to studies on omega-3 fatty acids and cardiovascular health."}{"title": "SAIFUL F:Saiful F is a researcher involved in studies on omega-3 fatty acids and their effects on cardiac arrhythmias."}{"title": "JAFFERY Z:Jaffery Z is a researcher who has studied the impact of omega-3 fatty acids on cardiovascular health."}{"title": "KENIGSBERG DN:Kenigsberg DN is a researcher involved in studies on omega-3 fatty acids and cardiac events."}{"title": "BERNSTEIN AM:Bernstein AM is a researcher who has published studies on the effects of omega-3 fatty acids on cholesterol levels."}{"title": "DING EL:Ding EL is a researcher involved in studies on omega-3 fatty acids and cardiovascular health."}{"title": "WILLETT WC:Willett WC is a prominent researcher in the field of nutritional epidemiology, recognized for his significant contributions to dietary assessment methods. His research encompasses a wide range of topics, including the impact of dietary factors on cardiovascular health and the nutritional elements related to hypertension. Through his work, Willett WC has advanced the understanding of how diet influences various health outcomes, making him a key figure in nutritional research."}{"title": "RIMM EB:Rimm EB is a prominent researcher known for his contributions to the field of nutrition and health. He is a co-author of a study that investigates the relationship between nutritional factors and hypertension among men in the United States. Additionally, Rimm EB has been involved in research focusing on omega-3 fatty acids and their impact on cardiovascular outcomes. His work also encompasses the study of dietary patterns and their effects on various health outcomes, highlighting his comprehensive approach to understanding the interplay between diet and health."}{"title": "ENNS JE:Enns JE is a researcher who has studied the impact of omega-3 fatty acids on cardiovascular events."}{"title": "YEGANEH A:Yeganeh A is a researcher involved in studies on omega-3 fatty acids and cardiovascular complications."}{"title": "ZARYCHANSKI R:Zarychanski R is a researcher who has contributed to studies on omega-3 fatty acids and cardiovascular health."}{"title": "ABOU-SETTA AM:Abou-Setta AM is a researcher involved in studies on omega-3 fatty acids and their effects on cardiovascular events."}{"title": "FRIESEN C:Friesen C is a researcher who has studied the impact of omega-3 fatty acids on cardiovascular health."}{"title": "ZAHRADKA P:Zahradka P is a researcher involved in studies on omega-